an  they join a google meet video call so  they can talk face to face  her team decides they would like to hire  a contractor to install railings along  both sides of the stairs  they work with the management legal and  finance teams in real time to update and  finalize the contract  back in the app asi is able to document  the steps taken to address this risk  once the contractor is finished  installing the railings ask is able to  close the ticket by selecting resolve  this is just one example of the many  types of safety apps you could build  using these google cloud solutions  creating applications such as these can  take days or weeks not months or years  to build  allowing businesses to work safer faster  and better  to learn more and to access this and  other app templates click on the link  below  [Music]  you
 

